 1/2 media: iris: send the stream's POC type to the firmware
     Author: Diogo Trindade <diogotr7@gmail.com>
     Taken from: https://github.com/armada-os/armada/blob/b031deef99a095104ef234c5a0705850152dffe1/packages/kernel/patches/1030-media-iris-send-the-stream-POC-type.patch
 2/2 media: iris: stop the AV1 tier overwriting the HEVC tier
     Author: Diogo Trindade <diogotr7@gmail.com>
